        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>醉翁亭记</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 28px 14px;\n      background: #ddd8c9;\n      color: #181816;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"DFKai-SB\", serif;\n    }\n    .sheet {\n      position: relative;\n      width: min(840px, 100%);\n      min-height: 1110px;\n      padding: 48px 45px 40px 78px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          to bottom,\n          transparent 0,\n          transparent 34px,\n          rgba(100, 121, 130, .20) 35px,\n          transparent 36px\n        ),\n        #fffdf5;\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.2);\n      transform: rotate(-.3deg);\n    }\n    .margin-line {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      left: 61px;\n      border-left: 1px solid rgba(185, 83, 64, .42);\n    }\n    .spiral {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 8px;\n      top: 17px;\n      bottom: 14px;\n      width: 48px;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 0 7px, #777 7.5px 9px, #c7c7b8 9.5px 12px, transparent 12.5px) center top / 48px 32px repeat-y;\n      opacity: .9;\n    }\n    .top {\n      min-height: 54px;\n      padding-left: 34px;\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n    .title {\n      font-size: 31px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    .unit {\n      color: #df9d00;\n      font-family: sans-serif;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      margin-right: 7px;\n    }\n    .source {\n      font-size: 15px;\n      color: #9d601a;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n    .subtitle {\n      margin-top: 7px;\n      color: #272727;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .body-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 174px;\n      gap: 15px;\n      align-items: start;\n    }\n    .text {\n      font-size: 25px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      line-height: 1.32;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    .paragraph {\n      position: relative;\n      min-height: 58px;\n      padding: 5px 0 2px;\n    }\n    .paragraph.marked::before {\n      content: \"▣\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: -20px;\n      top: 5px;\n      font-family: sans-serif;\n      color: #c85843;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .word-note {\n      color: #163a86;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", serif;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: normal;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .box {\n      display: inline;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(38, 68, 155, .65);\n      padding: 0 2px;\n    }\n    .red {\n      position: absolute;\n      color: #b63236;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: normal;\n      transform: rotate(-8deg);\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .r1 { left: -28px; top: 30px; }\n    .r2 { left: 88px; top: -8px; }\n    .r3 { left: 296px; top: 30px; }\n    .r4 { left: 43px; top: 34px; }\n    .notes {\n      min-height: 960px;\n      padding: 4px 0 0 9px;\n      border-left: 1px solid rgba(54, 94, 142, .3);\n      color: #1d347c;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      line-height: 1.25;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n    .note {\n      margin: 0 0 9px;\n    }\n    .note b {\n      color: #b32a32;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .note .redink { color: #ad3036; }\n    .under {\n      border-bottom: 2px solid #bf3636;\n    }\n    .bottom {\n      margin-top: 9px;\n      padding-left: 4px;\n      font-size: 26px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 620px) {\n      body { padding: 0; }\n      .sheet { min-height: 100vh; padding-right: 18px; padding-left: 64px; }\n      .body-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 115px; gap: 7px; }\n      .text, .bottom { font-size: 20px; }\n      .notes { font-size: 10px; padding-left: 4px; }\n      .word-note { font-size: 10px; }\n      .title { font-size: 25px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"sheet\">\n    <div class=\"spiral\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"margin-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n    <header class=\"top\">\n      <div class=\"title\"><span class=\"unit\">11.</span>醉翁亭记 <span class=\"source\">北宋·欧阳修</span></div>\n      <div class=\"subtitle\">☑ 作者及其背景</div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"body-grid\">\n      <article class=\"text\">\n        <div class=\"paragraph\">\n          环滁皆山也。其西南诸峰，林壑尤美，<span class=\"box\">望之蔚然而深秀者，</span>琅琊也。\n          <span class=\"word-note\">[环滁：环绕滁州]</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph marked\">\n          山行六七里，渐闻水声潺潺，而泻出于两峰之间者，酿泉也。\n          <span class=\"word-note\">[翼然：像鸟张开翅膀的样子]</span>\n          <span class=\"red r1\">亭子<br>作用</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph marked\">\n          峰回路转，<span class=\"box\">有亭翼然临于泉上者，</span>醉翁亭也。\n          <span class=\"red r2\">亭</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph\">\n          作亭者谁？山之僧曰智仙也。名之者谁？太守自谓也。\n          <span class=\"word-note\">[名：命名]　[自谓：自称]</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph marked\">\n          太守与客来饮于此，饮少辄醉，而年又最高，故自号曰醉翁也。\n          <span class=\"word-note\">[辄：就]　[号：取别号]</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph\">\n          醉翁之意不在酒，在乎山水之间也。山水之乐，得之心而寓之酒也。\n          <span class=\"word-note\">[意：情趣]　[得：领会]　[寓：寄托]</span>\n          <span class=\"red r3\">醉翁亭记</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph\">\n          若夫日出而林霏开，云归而岩穴暝。晦明变化者，山间之朝暮也。\n          <span class=\"word-note\">[若夫：像那]　[林霏开：树林里的雾气散了]</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph\">\n          野芳发而幽香，佳木秀而繁阴。风霜高洁，水落而石出者，山间之四时也。\n          <span class=\"word-note\">[野芳：野花]　[秀：茂盛]　[高洁：高爽洁净]</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph\">\n          朝而往，暮而归，四时之景不同，而乐亦无穷也。\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph\">\n          至于负者歌于途，行者休于树，前者呼，后者应，伛偻提携，往来而不绝者，滁人游也。\n          <span class=\"word-note\">[负者：背着东西的人]　[伛偻：老人]　[提携：小孩]</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph\">\n          临溪而渔，溪深而鱼肥。酿泉为酒，泉香而酒洌；山肴野蔌，杂然而前陈者，太守宴也。\n          <span class=\"word-note\">[洌：清]　[陈：陈列、摆开]</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph\">\n          宴酣之乐，非丝非竹，射者中，弈者胜，觥筹交错，起坐而喧哗者，众宾欢也。\n          <span class=\"word-note\">[丝：弦乐器]　[竹：管乐器]　[觥筹：酒杯和酒筹]</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph\">\n          苍颜白发，颓然乎其间者，太守醉也。\n          <span class=\"word-note\">[苍颜：脸色苍老]　[颓然：倒下的样子]</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"paragraph\">\n          已而夕阳在山，人影散乱，太守归而宾客从也。树林阴翳，鸣声上下，游人去而禽鸟乐也。\n          <span class=\"word-note\">[已而：不久]　[翳：遮盖]</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <aside class=\"notes\">\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>①</b>环滁(chú)：环绕滁州。<br>滁州：今安徽滁州。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>②</b>林壑：山谷。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>③</b>蔚然：茂盛的样子。<br><b>④</b>深秀：幽深秀丽。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>⑤</b>琅琊：山名，在今安徽滁州西南。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>⑥</b>酿泉：泉名。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>⑦</b>翼然：像鸟张开翅膀的样子。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>⑧</b>临：靠近。<br><b>⑨</b>自谓：自称。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>⑩</b>辄：就。<br><b>⑪</b>意：情趣。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>⑫</b>得之心：领会在心里。<br><b>⑬</b>寓之酒也：寄托在饮酒中。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>⑭</b>若夫：像那。<br><b>⑮</b>林霏开：树林里的雾气散了。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>⑯</b>云归：云雾聚拢。<br><b>⑰</b>暝：昏暗。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>⑱</b>晦明变化：明暗交替。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>⑲</b>野芳发而幽香：野花开放，散发幽香。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><b>⑳</b>佳木秀而繁阴：好的树木枝叶繁茂，形成浓阴。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><span class=\"redink\">●</span> 风霜高洁：天高气爽，霜色洁白。</div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><span class=\"redink\">●</span> 负者：背着东西的人。<br><span class=\"redink\">●</span> 伛偻：老人。</div>\n      </aside>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"bottom\">\n      然而禽鸟知山林之乐，而不知人之乐；人知从太守游而乐，而不知太守之乐其乐也。<br>\n      醉能同其乐，醒能述以文者，太守也。太守谓谁？庐陵欧阳修也。\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
